#: ../developer/batches.md:1
msgid "Batch Inference"
msgstr "批量推理"

#: ../developer/batches.md:3
msgid ""
"A batch is many inference requests handed to the gateway in one call and "
"answered later. You submit the whole job, poll it, then collect the "
"results. The gateway runs the requests in the background, a few at a time"
" per model, beside its interactive traffic."
msgstr "批次是一次调用交给网关、稍后才给出结果的许多推理请求。你提交整个任务，轮询它的状态，然后收取结果。网关在后台运行这些请求，每个模型同时只跑几个，与交互式流量并行。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:8
msgid ""
"There is one batch API, `/v1/batches`. Every batch has one **target**, "
"the endpoint each of its requests is for:"
msgstr "网关只有一个 Batch API：`/v1/batches`。每个批次有一个**目标**，即批次中每个请求所发往的端点："

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Target"
msgstr "目标"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`url` / `endpoint`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Request body"
msgstr "请求体"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Chat completions"
msgstr "Chat Completions"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`/v1/chat/completions`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "A chat completion request"
msgstr "一个 Chat Completions 请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Embeddings"
msgstr "Embeddings"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`/v1/embeddings`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "An embeddings request"
msgstr "一个 Embeddings 请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Responses"
msgstr "Responses"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`/v1/responses`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "An independent Responses request"
msgstr "一个独立的 Responses 请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Messages"
msgstr "Messages"

