msgid ""
"An Anthropic Messages request; the create call also sends the `anthropic-"
"version` header"
msgstr "一个 Anthropic Messages 请求；创建调用还要发送 `anthropic-version` 请求头"

#: ../developer/batches.md:18
msgid ""
"Its requests arrive in one of two ways, the **input methods** of the same"
" batch resource:"
msgstr "请求可以通过两种方式提交，它们是同一个批次资源的两种**输入方式**："

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Input method"
msgstr "输入方式"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "提交"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Results"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Direct requests"
msgstr "直接提交请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`POST /v1/batches` with the requests in a `requests` array"
msgstr "`POST /v1/batches`，请求放在 `requests` 数组里"

#: ../developer/batches.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Paged from `/v1/batches/{id}/results`, or one JSONL export"
msgstr "从 `/v1/batches/{id}/results` 分页读取，或一次导出为 JSONL"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "JSONL file"
msgstr "JSONL 文件"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid ""
"Upload a JSONL file to `/v1/files`, then `POST /v1/batches` with its "
"`input_file_id`"
msgstr "先把 JSONL 文件上传到 `/v1/files`，再带上它的 `input_file_id` 调用 `POST /v1/batches`"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "An output file and an error file, downloaded from `/v1/files`"
msgstr "一个输出文件和一个错误文件，从 `/v1/files` 下载"

#: ../developer/batches.md:26
msgid ""
"Whatever the target and input method, a batch is the same object, with "
"the same statuses, counts, results, cancel and delete. The shapes follow "
"OpenAI's Batch API; the differences are listed at the end of this page."
msgstr "无论目标和输入方式如何，批次都是同一种对象，状态、计数、结果、取消和删除都一样。形状沿用 OpenAI 的 Batch API；差异列在本页末尾。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:30
msgid ""
"The official OpenAI SDKs work with the file flow for the chat, embeddings"
" and Responses targets: point the SDK's base URL at `https://your-"
"gateway.example/v1` and pass your gateway API key. The Messages target is"
" this gateway's extension of that shape. Anthropic's own Message Batches "
"API (`/v1/messages/batches`, the Anthropic SDKs' `messages.batches`) is "
"no longer served: its routes answer `410`; see [Moving from Message "
"Batches](#moving-from-message-batches). There is no HybridInference SDK "
"of its own. Direct requests and the results pages are this gateway's own,"
" so the SDKs have no methods for them; call them over HTTP, as the "
"examples below do."
msgstr ""
"官方 OpenAI SDK 可以用文件方式提交 Chat、Embeddings 和 Responses 目标的批次：把 SDK 的 base "
"URL 指向 `https://your-gateway.example/v1`，并传入你的网关 API 密钥。Messages "
"目标是本网关对这一形状的扩展。网关不再提供 Anthropic 自己的 Message Batches "
"API（`/v1/messages/batches`，即 Anthropic SDK 的 `messages.batches`），它的路由返回 "
"`410`；见[从 Message Batches 迁移](#moving-from-message-"
"batches)。HybridInference 没有自己的 SDK。直接提交请求和结果分页是本网关自有的接口，SDK "
"没有对应的方法；请像下面的示例那样直接通过 HTTP 调用。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:42
msgid ""
"Only **internal** users and administrators can create batches unless the "
"operator opens them to other roles. A gateway with batch inference turned"
" off, or without a database, answers every batch route with `404`. "
"Otherwise everything on this page is available: both input methods, every"
" target, and webhooks."
msgstr ""
"默认只有 **internal** 用户和管理员可以创建批次，除非运营者向其他角色开放。网关关闭批量推理或没有数据库时，所有批次路由都返回 "
"`404`。否则本页介绍的全部功能都可用：两种输入方式、所有目标以及 webhook。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:49
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../developer/batches.md:51
msgid ""
"Creating a batch stores its requests; nothing runs during that call. "
"Every request is checked before any of them runs: direct requests are "
"checked whole before the call answers ([Create a "
"batch](#create-a-batch)), and a file is checked whole in the background "
"([Batches from a file](#batches-from-a-file)). One invalid request "
"refuses the whole batch, and a refused batch has made no inference call "
"at all. A batch starts as `validating`, and the gateway's worker starts "
"its requests as soon as their models have room. From then on each request"
" succeeds or fails on its own: a request the model rejects, or that still"
" fails after its retries, fails alone, and the others keep running."
msgstr ""
"创建批次时会存下它的请求；这次调用本身不运行任何请求。任何请求运行之前，所有请求都会先经过校验：直接提交的请求在调用返回前整体校验（[创建批次](#create-a-batch)），文件在后台整体校验（[来自文件的批次"
"](#batches-from-a-file)）。只要有一个请求无效，整个批次就会被拒绝，被拒绝的批次没有发出任何推理调用。批次一开始处于 "
"`validating`，只要其模型有空余，网关的 worker "
"就会开始运行它的请求。从这时起，每个请求各自成功或失败：被模型拒绝、或重试后仍失败的请求只有它自己失败，其他请求继续运行。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:61
msgid ""
"Each request then runs exactly as if you had sent it to its endpoint "
"yourself: the same models, routing and fallback, the same price, logged "
"under your account. It counts toward your daily cost quota. It does "
"**not** take a slot of your concurrent-request limit: batch work has a "
"separate quota per role, so a running batch does not use up the slots "
"your interactive requests need, and they do not use up the batch's."
msgstr "之后每个请求的运行方式与你亲自把它发到对应端点完全相同：同样的模型、路由和回退，同样的价格，记在你的账户下。它计入你的每日费用额度。它**不**占用你的并发请求名额：批量任务按角色有单独的配额，所以运行中的批次不会用掉交互式请求需要的名额，交互式请求也不会用掉批次的名额。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:68
msgid ""
"Batch and interactive requests still share the models and the upstream "
"servers behind them. By default a model runs fewer batch requests while "
"interactive requests are in flight on it, so a batch gives way to "
"interactive traffic on the same model and may slow down while that "
"traffic is heavy (see [Running batch inference](#running-batch-"
"inference))."
msgstr ""
"批量请求和交互式请求仍然共享模型及其背后的上游服务器。默认情况下，某个模型上有交互式请求在处理时，它会少运行一些批量请求，因此批次会为同一模型上的交互式流量让路，在交互流量大时可能变慢（见[运行批量推理"
"](#running-batch-inference)）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:74
msgid ""
"Requests run in no particular order, and a request that fails for a "
"reason that may pass — a timeout, a `429`, a `5xx` — is retried with "
"backoff, up to eight attempts in all. A request the model rejects (any "
"other `4xx`) fails at once."
msgstr ""
"请求的运行顺序不固定。因可能自行恢复的原因失败的请求——超时、`429`、`5xx`——会带退避重试，最多共尝试八次。被模型拒绝的请求（其他任何 "
"`4xx`）会立即失败。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:79
msgid ""
"Before each request runs, the gateway checks the API key that created the"
" batch again:"
msgstr "每个请求运行前，网关都会再次检查创建该批次的 API key："

#: ../developer/batches.md:82
msgid ""
"if the key was revoked or has expired, or the account was suspended or "
"deleted, the batch fails;"
msgstr "如果 key 已被吊销或过期，或账户已被停用或删除，批次失败；"

#: ../developer/batches.md:84
msgid ""
"if your daily quota is used up, your batches pause until it renews at "
"midnight UTC;"
msgstr "如果你的每日额度已用完，你的批次会暂停，直到额度在 UTC 午夜刷新；"

#: ../developer/batches.md:86
msgid "if your role no longer allows batches, they pause until it does."
msgstr "如果你的角色不再允许使用批量推理，批次会暂停，直到重新允许为止。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:88
msgid "So keep the key you created a batch with until the batch finishes."
msgstr "所以在批次完成之前，请保留创建它所用的 key。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:90
msgid "Create a batch"
msgstr "创建批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:92
msgid "`POST /v1/batches` with your API key:"
msgstr "用你的 API key 调用 `POST /v1/batches`："

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必填"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`requests`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "The requests, at least one"
msgstr "请求列表，至少一个"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`requests[].custom_id`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Your name for the request, 1–512 characters, unique in the batch. Results"
" carry it back"
msgstr "你给请求起的名字，1–512 个字符，在批次内唯一。结果中会原样带回"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`requests[].method`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`POST`, the default"
msgstr "`POST`，默认值"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`requests[].url`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"The target: `/v1/chat/completions` (the default), `/v1/embeddings`, "
"`/v1/responses` or `/v1/messages`. Every request of one batch uses the "
"same `url`"
msgstr ""
"目标：`/v1/chat/completions`（默认）、`/v1/embeddings`、`/v1/responses` 或 "
"`/v1/messages`。同一批次的所有请求使用同一个 `url`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`requests[].body`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"The request body, as you would send it to that endpoint. `stream` must "
"not be `true`"
msgstr "请求体，与你直接发给该端点时一样。`stream` 不能为 `true`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`metadata`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Up to 16 string pairs for your own use; keys up to 64 characters, values "
"up to 512"
msgstr "最多 16 对字符串，供你自己使用；键最长 64 个字符，值最长 512 个字符"

#: ../developer/batches.md:132
msgid ""
"One batch may use several models. Auto models (`auto`, `auto-<tier>`) "
"cannot be used in a batch; name a specific model."
msgstr "一个批次可以使用多个模型。自动模型（`auto`、`auto-<tier>`）不能用于批次；请指定具体模型。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:135
msgid ""
"If that name is an alias, the stored request retains the name you sent, "
"but the worker dispatches it to the canonical model the alias named when "
"you created the batch. Changing an alias later cannot move already-"
"submitted work to another model or another model's concurrency limit."
msgstr ""
"如果该名称是别名，存储的请求保留你发送的名称，但 worker "
"会把它分派到你创建批次时该别名所指向的规范模型。之后修改别名，不会把已提交的任务转到另一个模型或另一个模型的并发上限下。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:140
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The whole batch is refused when any request in it is invalid. The error "
"has the gateway's usual `{\"error\": {...}}` shape, and its message names"
" the request:"
msgstr "只要批次中有任何一个请求无效，整个批次都会被拒绝。错误采用网关通常的 `{\"error\": {...}}` 格式，消息里会指出是哪个请求："

#: ../developer/batches.md:152
msgid "A model you may not use is reported exactly like one that does not exist."
msgstr "你无权使用的模型，报错方式与不存在的模型完全相同。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:154
msgid ""
"A Messages batch also sends the `anthropic-version` header with this "
"call; see [Messages in a batch](#messages-in-a-batch)."
msgstr ""
"Messages 批次在这次调用中还要发送 `anthropic-version` 请求头；见[批次中的 Messages](#messages-"
"in-a-batch)。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:157
msgid "The answer is the new batch:"
msgstr "返回的是新建的批次："

#: ../developer/batches.md:186
msgid ""
"A batch of direct requests has no files, so its file fields are `null`. "
"Several fields are not in OpenAI's object: `anthropic_version`, the "
"version a Messages batch was created with (`null` otherwise); `cost_usd`,"
" what the batch's finished requests were billed so far; "
"`cost_unknown_attempts`, attempts whose cost is unknown and not in "
"`cost_usd` (see [Costs](#costs)); `results_expires_at`, when the results "
"will be deleted; and `error`, why the whole batch failed. `usage` totals "
"the tokens of the finished requests."
msgstr ""
"直接提交请求的批次没有文件，所以它的文件字段都是 `null`。有几个字段不在 OpenAI "
"的对象中：`anthropic_version`，Messages 批次创建时使用的版本（其他批次为 "
"`null`）；`cost_usd`，批次中已结束请求目前的计费；`cost_unknown_attempts`，费用未知、未计入 "
"`cost_usd` 的尝试数（见[费用](#costs)）；`results_expires_at`，结果将被删除的时间；以及 "
"`error`，整个批次失败的原因。`usage` 汇总已结束请求的 token 数。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:194
msgid "Check on a batch"
msgstr "查看批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:196
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/batches/{id}` returns the batch object again. Poll it until "
"`status` is one of the four final ones:"
msgstr "`GET /v1/batches/{id}` 再次返回批次对象。轮询它，直到 `status` 成为四个最终状态之一："

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`validating`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Stored; no request has started yet"
msgstr "已存储；还没有请求开始运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`in_progress`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Requests are running"
msgstr "请求正在运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`finalizing`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"A file batch: every request has finished and its output files are being "
"written"
msgstr "文件批次：所有请求都已结束，正在写入输出文件"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`completed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Every request has finished, successfully or not. Read each one's outcome "
"in the results"
msgstr "所有请求都已结束，无论成功与否。每个请求的结果请在结果中查看"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`failed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"The batch stopped because its creating key or account is no longer valid;"
" `error` says so (`owner_unauthorized`), and unstarted requests fail with"
" `batch_failed`. A file batch also fails if its input cannot be "
"validated; no request runs and `errors` lists the problems"
msgstr ""
"创建批次的密钥或账户已失效，批次停止；`error` 会说明原因（`owner_unauthorized`），未启动的请求以 "
"`batch_failed` 失败。文件批次的输入无法通过校验时也会失败；此时不会执行任何请求，`errors` 会列出问题"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`expired`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"The completion window (`completion_window`, from `created_at` to "
"`expires_at`) closed first. Requests that had not started are `expired` "
"with `batch_expired`; finished ones keep their results"
msgstr ""
"完成窗口（`completion_window`，从 `created_at` 到 `expires_at`）先关闭了。尚未开始的请求为 "
"`expired`，错误为 `batch_expired`；已结束的请求保留其结果"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`cancelling`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Cancelled while requests were running; they are finishing"
msgstr "在请求运行期间被取消；这些请求正在收尾"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`cancelled`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Cancelled. Requests that had not started never will"
msgstr "已取消。尚未开始的请求不会再运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:210
msgid ""
"`request_counts.completed` counts the requests that succeeded and "
"`request_counts.failed` those that failed, including the ones a failed or"
" expired batch never ran. Cancelled requests are in neither."
msgstr ""
"`request_counts.completed` 统计成功的请求，`request_counts.failed` "
"统计失败的请求，包括失败或过期的批次从未运行的请求。已取消的请求两边都不计入。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:214
msgid "Read the results"
msgstr "读取结果"

#: ../developer/batches.md:216
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/batches/{id}/results` pages through the batch's requests in the "
"order you submitted them, with each one's outcome:"
msgstr "`GET /v1/batches/{id}/results` 按你提交的顺序分页列出批次的请求及各自的结果："

#: ../developer/batches.md:265
msgid ""
"`limit` is 1–1000 (default 100). When `has_more` is `true`, ask for the "
"next page with `after` set to the page's `last_id`. Every request of the "
"batch is listed, finished or not. A request still `queued` or `running` "
"has no `response` yet, but may retain its last `error` while being "
"retried. Read the results once the batch is in a final status, or read "
"them again later."
msgstr ""
"`limit` 为 1–1000，默认 100。当 `has_more` 为 `true` 时，将本页的 `last_id` 作为 `after`"
" 获取下一页。批次中的所有请求都会列出，无论是否完成。仍处于 `queued` 或 `running` 的请求尚无 "
"`response`，但在重试时可能保留上一次的 `error`。请在批次达到最终状态后读取结果，或稍后再次读取。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:271
msgid ""
"A finished request has a `status` of `completed`, with its endpoint's "
"response (a chat completion, an embeddings list, a Responses object or a "
"Messages `message`) in `response.body`, or `failed`, with an `error` "
"instead. A request that never ran is `cancelled`, `expired` or `failed`. "
"Error codes:"
msgstr ""
"已结束的请求 `status` 为 `completed` 时，`response.body` 中是其端点的响应（Chat "
"Completion、Embeddings 列表、Responses 对象或 Messages 的 `message`）；为 `failed` "
"时则带有 `error`。从未运行的请求为 `cancelled`、`expired` 或 `failed`。错误码："

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`code`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`invalid_request`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "The model rejected the request (`400`, `422`)"
msgstr "模型拒绝了请求（`400`、`422`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`model_not_found`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "The model is gone, or you may no longer use it (`404`)"
msgstr "模型已不存在，或你已无权使用它（`404`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`forbidden`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Refused (`403`)"
msgstr "被拒绝（`403`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`rate_limited`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Still rate-limited after every retry (`429`)"
msgstr "所有重试之后仍被限流（`429`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`timeout`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Still timing out after every retry (`504`)"
msgstr "所有重试之后仍然超时（`504`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`service_unavailable`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "No endpoint could serve it after every retry (`503`)"
msgstr "所有重试之后仍没有端点能处理它（`503`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`upstream_error`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Another server error after every retry"
msgstr "所有重试之后仍是其他服务器错误"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`batch_failed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Not run: the batch failed"
msgstr "未运行：批次失败了"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`batch_expired`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Not run before the completion window closed"
msgstr "完成窗口关闭前未能运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:288
msgid "`error.status` is the HTTP status behind the error, when there was one."
msgstr "`error.status` 是导致该错误的 HTTP 状态码（如果有的话）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:290
msgid ""
"A short Python client that submits a batch, waits for it and collects "
"every result:"
msgstr "一个简短的 Python 客户端，提交批次、等待完成并收取全部结果："

#: ../developer/batches.md:336
msgid "Cancel or delete a batch"
msgstr "取消或删除批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:338
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/batches/{id}/cancel` stops a batch. Requests that have not "
"started are cancelled; running ones finish and keep their results. The "
"batch is `cancelling` until they do, then `cancelled`. Cancelling a batch"
" that has already finished returns it unchanged."
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/batches/{id}/cancel` "
"停止一个批次。尚未开始的请求被取消；正在运行的请求会跑完并保留结果。在它们结束之前，批次处于 `cancelling`，之后变为 "
"`cancelled`。取消一个已经结束的批次，会原样返回它。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:343
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`DELETE /v1/batches/{id}` deletes a batch with its requests and results "
"and answers `{\"id\": \"batch_...\", \"object\": \"batch.deleted\", "
"\"deleted\": true}`. Its status does not matter, but deletion is blocked "
"with `409` while any request holds a live upstream lease. Cancel the "
"batch, wait for its running requests to finish (or their leases to "
"expire), then delete it. A stale `running` item whose lease has expired "
"does not block deletion."
msgstr ""
"`DELETE /v1/batches/{id}` 删除批次及其请求和结果，并返回 `{\"id\": \"batch_...\", "
"\"object\": \"batch.deleted\", \"deleted\": "
"true}`。批次处于什么状态都可以删除，但只要还有请求持有有效的上游租约，删除就会以 `409` "
"被阻止。请先取消批次，等它正在运行的请求结束（或其租约过期），再删除。租约已过期的陈旧 `running` 条目不会阻止删除。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:350
msgid ""
"A finished batch is deleted automatically after the deployment's "
"retention period, seven days by default, so collect its results before "
"then."
msgstr "已结束的批次会在部署设定的保留期（默认七天）后被自动删除，请在此之前收取结果。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:353
msgid "List your batches"
msgstr "列出你的批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:355
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/batches` lists your own batches, newest first. `limit` is 1–100 "
"(default 20); for the next page pass `after` set to the `last_id` of the "
"previous one. The answer has the shape of a results page, with batch "
"objects in `data`. It lists every batch of yours, of every target and "
"input method, including those created through the former "
"`/v1/messages/batches` (their ids start with `msgbatch_`)."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/batches` 按时间倒序列出你自己的批次。`limit` 为 1–100（默认 20）；要取下一页，把 `after` "
"设为上一页的 `last_id`。返回结果与结果分页的形状相同，`data` "
"中是批次对象。它列出你所有的批次，涵盖每种目标和输入方式，包括通过已移除的 `/v1/messages/batches` 创建的批次（它们的 id"
" 以 `msgbatch_` 开头）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:362
msgid ""
"Reading, downloading, cancelling, deleting and listing your batches work "
"even if your role no longer allows creating them or your daily quota is "
"used up, so you can always collect and remove what you submitted, with "
"any of your API keys. Another user's batch reads as not found. "
"Administrators may read, cancel and delete any batch."
msgstr ""
"即使你的角色已不再允许创建批次，或每日额度已用完，读取、下载、取消、删除和列出你的批次仍然可用，所以你总能用任意一个自己的 API key "
"收取并清理提交过的内容。其他用户的批次会被视为不存在。管理员可以读取、取消和删除任何批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:368
msgid "Batches from a file"
msgstr "来自文件的批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:370
msgid ""
"Upload a JSONL file whose every line is one request, then create a batch "
"from it."
msgstr "上传一个每行为一个请求的 JSONL 文件，然后用它创建批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:383
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each line is `{\"custom_id\", \"method\": \"POST\", \"url\", \"body\"}`, "
"the `url` equal to the batch's `endpoint`. Every line must use the same "
"model. A file batch for `/v1/messages` also sends the `anthropic-version`"
" header with the create call, and every line is checked under that "
"version."
msgstr ""
"每一行是 `{\"custom_id\", \"method\": \"POST\", \"url\", \"body\"}`，其中 `url` "
"必须等于批次的 `endpoint`。每一行必须使用同一个模型。`/v1/messages` 的文件批次在创建调用中还要发送 "
"`anthropic-version` 请求头，每一行都按该版本校验。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:388
msgid ""
"The batch starts as `validating` while the gateway reads the file in the "
"background. If any line is invalid — not JSON, a repeated `custom_id`, "
"another `url` or model, a body the endpoint would refuse — the whole "
"batch is `failed` and nothing of it runs; `errors` lists the problems "
"with their line numbers. Otherwise it moves to `in_progress`. Once every "
"request has finished it is `finalizing` for a moment while its result "
"files are written, and then reaches its final status with "
"`output_file_id` (the successful requests) and `error_file_id` (the "
"others) set; either is `null` when it has no lines."
msgstr ""
"网关在后台读取文件期间，批次处于 `validating`。只要有一行无效——不是 JSON、`custom_id` 重复、`url` "
"或模型与其他行不同、请求体会被该端点拒绝——整个批次就会 `failed`，其中任何请求都不会运行；`errors` "
"会列出问题及其行号。否则批次进入 `in_progress`。所有请求结束后，批次会短暂处于 "
"`finalizing`，写入结果文件，然后进入最终状态，并设置 `output_file_id`（成功的请求）和 "
"`error_file_id`（其余请求）；没有对应行时该字段为 `null`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:397
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Download them with `GET /v1/files/{id}/content`. A result file is the "
"same bytes every time it is downloaded, and its size and SHA-256 (the "
"`ETag`) are fixed when the batch ends. `GET /v1/files` lists your files, "
"`GET /v1/files/{id}` returns one, and `DELETE /v1/files/{id}` deletes one"
" for good: a deleted output file is not written again, though the batch "
"still names it. Deleting an input file does not affect a batch already "
"created from it."
msgstr ""
"用 `GET /v1/files/{id}/content` 下载它们。结果文件每次下载都是相同的字节，其大小和 SHA-256（即 "
"`ETag`）在批次结束时就已确定。`GET /v1/files` 列出你的文件，`GET /v1/files/{id}` "
"返回其中一个，`DELETE /v1/files/{id}` "
"将其永久删除：被删除的输出文件不会重新生成，尽管批次仍会引用它。删除输入文件不影响已经用它创建的批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:404
msgid "The official OpenAI SDKs work with this flow:"
msgstr "官方 OpenAI SDK 支持这一流程："

#: ../developer/batches.md:418
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The results of a batch of direct requests are also available as one JSONL"
" file, in the same line shape, once it has ended: `GET "
"/v1/batches/{id}/output.jsonl`."
msgstr ""
"直接提交请求的批次结束后，它的结果也可以作为一个 JSONL 文件获取，行的形状相同：`GET "
"/v1/batches/{id}/output.jsonl`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:421
msgid "Messages in a batch"
msgstr "批次中的 Messages"

#: ../developer/batches.md:423
msgid ""
"A batch whose target is `/v1/messages` carries Anthropic Messages request"
" bodies, and its create call names the Anthropic API version they are "
"written for in the `anthropic-version` header, as Anthropic's API does:"
msgstr ""
"目标为 `/v1/messages` 的批次携带 Anthropic Messages 请求体，创建调用像 Anthropic 的 API "
"一样，在 `anthropic-version` 请求头中给出这些请求所针对的 Anthropic API 版本："

#: ../developer/batches.md:446
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"From a file, every line has `\"url\": \"/v1/messages\"`, and the create "
"call (`{\"input_file_id\": \"file-…\", \"endpoint\": \"/v1/messages\", "
"\"completion_window\": \"24h\"}`) sends the same header. With the OpenAI "
"SDK:"
msgstr ""
"使用文件时，每一行都是 `\"url\": \"/v1/messages\"`，创建调用（`{\"input_file_id\": "
"\"file-…\", \"endpoint\": \"/v1/messages\", \"completion_window\": "
"\"24h\"}`）发送同样的请求头。使用 OpenAI SDK 时："

#: ../developer/batches.md:459
msgid ""
"The header is required for a Messages batch, and refused on any other. "
"`2023-06-01` and `2026-10-21` are known; the operator chooses which of "
"them new batches may use (`BATCH_ANTHROPIC_VERSIONS`). A batch keeps its "
"version (the batch object shows it as `anthropic_version`), and every "
"request is checked, and runs, under it: under `2026-10-21`, "
"`temperature`, `top_p` and `top_k` are refused, as are document blocks in"
" assistant messages and citations on user text. Only the header names it:"
" an `anthropic_version` field in the body is refused, and so is one "
"inside a request's body."
msgstr ""
"Messages 批次必须提供这个请求头，其他批次提供会被拒绝。已知的版本是 `2023-06-01` 和 "
"`2026-10-21`；运营者决定新批次可以使用其中哪些（`BATCH_ANTHROPIC_VERSIONS`）。批次保留它的版本（批次对象中显示为"
" `anthropic_version`），每个请求都按该版本校验和运行：在 `2026-10-21` "
"下，`temperature`、`top_p` 和 `top_k` 会被拒绝，assistant 消息中的 document 块和 user "
"文本上的 citations 也会被拒绝。版本只能由请求头给出：请求体中的 `anthropic_version` "
"字段会被拒绝，单个请求体中的也一样。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:467
msgid ""
"Reading, listing, cancelling, deleting and downloading a batch need no "
"version header."
msgstr "读取、列出、取消、删除和下载批次都不需要版本请求头。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:469
msgid ""
"`anthropic-beta` is refused: batches support no beta, and a request body "
"cannot carry `betas` either."
msgstr "`anthropic-beta` 会被拒绝：批次不支持任何 beta，请求体也不能携带 `betas`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:471
msgid ""
"Each request is checked like any batch request: one the gateway cannot "
"run as written refuses the whole batch, naming it. That includes a model "
"you may not use (reported exactly as an unknown one), server tools, Files"
" API sources, MCP servers and containers, and any parameter a model's "
"route cannot carry — extended thinking, cache control or structured "
"output on a non-Anthropic backend, for example. A parameter is never "
"silently dropped."
msgstr ""
"每个请求都像其他批次请求一样校验：网关无法原样运行的请求会使整个批次被拒绝，错误中会指明是哪一个。包括你无权使用的模型（报告方式与未知模型完全相同）、服务端工具、Files"
" API 来源、MCP 服务器和 container，以及模型路由无法承载的任何参数——例如在非 Anthropic "
"后端上使用扩展思考、cache control 或结构化输出。参数绝不会被静默丢弃。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:477
msgid ""
"The result of a request is the same line as for any target, with the "
"Messages `message` in `response.body`."
msgstr "请求的结果与其他目标相同的一行，`response.body` 中是 Messages 的 `message`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:480
msgid ""
"Each request is a single inference turn. A result that asks for a tool "
"call is for your program to carry out and send back in a new request; the"
" gateway never runs your tools."
msgstr "每个请求都是单轮推理。要求调用工具的结果，需要由你的程序执行，并在新请求中把结果发回；网关从不运行你的工具。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:484
msgid "Moving from Message Batches"
msgstr "从 Message Batches 迁移"

#: ../developer/batches.md:486
msgid ""
"The Anthropic Message Batches routes — `/v1/messages/batches` and "
"`/anthropic/v1/messages/batches` with every operation under them — have "
"been removed. Each of their operations answers `410 Gone` with a short "
"note on where to go instead, whoever calls it and whatever the id; "
"nothing of the old API runs. The Anthropic SDKs' `messages.batches` "
"methods therefore fail against this gateway. Online `/v1/messages` (and "
"`/anthropic/v1/messages`) is unchanged. Use `/v1/batches` with the "
"Messages target instead:"
msgstr ""
"Anthropic Message Batches 路由——`/v1/messages/batches` 和 "
"`/anthropic/v1/messages/batches` 及其下的所有操作——已经移除。它们的每个操作都返回 `410 "
"Gone`，并附一段简短说明告诉你应改用哪里，不论调用者是谁、id 是什么；旧 API 的任何部分都不会运行。因此 Anthropic SDK 的"
" `messages.batches` 方法对本网关会失败。在线的 `/v1/messages`（以及 "
"`/anthropic/v1/messages`）不变。请改用 Messages 目标的 `/v1/batches`："

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Before"
msgstr "以前"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Now"
msgstr "现在"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/messages/batches`, header `anthropic-version`, body "
"`{\"requests\": [{\"custom_id\", \"params\"}]}`"
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/messages/batches`，请求头 `anthropic-version`，请求体 `{\"requests\": "
"[{\"custom_id\", \"params\"}]}`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/batches`, header `anthropic-version`, body `{\"requests\": "
"[{\"custom_id\", \"url\": \"/v1/messages\", \"body\"}]}`"
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/batches`，请求头 `anthropic-version`，请求体 `{\"requests\": "
"[{\"custom_id\", \"url\": \"/v1/messages\", \"body\"}]}`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /v1/messages/batches`, `GET …/{id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /v1/batches`, `GET /v1/batches/{id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST …/{id}/cancel`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /v1/batches/{id}/cancel`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`DELETE …/{id}`, only once ended"
msgstr "`DELETE …/{id}`，仅在结束后"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`DELETE /v1/batches/{id}`, refused only while a request is running"
msgstr "`DELETE /v1/batches/{id}`，只在有请求运行时被拒绝"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET …/{id}/results` (`{\"custom_id\", \"result\"}` lines)"
msgstr "`GET …/{id}/results`（`{\"custom_id\", \"result\"}` 行）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/batches/{id}/results` (pages) or `/output.jsonl` (the line shape"
" above)"
msgstr "`GET /v1/batches/{id}/results`（分页）或 `/output.jsonl`（上面的行形状）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`processing_status` `in_progress` / `canceling` / `ended`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`status`, as for every batch (`completed`, `cancelled`, `expired`, …)"
msgstr "`status`，与所有批次相同（`completed`、`cancelled`、`expired` 等）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"`request_counts` `processing` / `succeeded` / `errored` / `canceled` / "
"`expired`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`request_counts` `total` / `completed` / `failed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "An invalid request became one `errored` result and the others ran"
msgstr "无效的请求成为一条 `errored` 结果，其余请求照常运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "An invalid request refuses the whole batch before anything runs, naming it"
msgstr "无效的请求会在任何请求运行之前使整个批次被拒绝，并指明是哪一个"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`custom_id` up to 64 letters, digits, `_`, `-`"
msgstr "`custom_id` 最多 64 个字母、数字、`_`、`-`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`custom_id` of 1–512 characters"
msgstr "`custom_id` 为 1–512 个字符"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Webhook event `message_batch.ended`"
msgstr "Webhook 事件 `message_batch.ended`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"`batch.completed`, `batch.failed`, `batch.expired` or `batch.cancelled` "
"for a new batch"
msgstr "新批次为 `batch.completed`、`batch.failed`、`batch.expired` 或 `batch.cancelled`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:507
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Batches created through the removed routes are kept and still run. They "
"are listed, read, cancelled, deleted and downloaded through `/v1/batches`"
" and the console like any other batch (their ids start with `msgbatch_`),"
" in the shapes above: their results come as the common result lines, no "
"longer as `{\"custom_id\", \"result\"}` lines. When one of them ends, its"
" webhook event is still `message_batch.ended`, the event it was created "
"under; its id works on `/v1/batches`. An `Idempotency-Key` used on the "
"removed routes does not replay through `/v1/batches`."
msgstr ""
"通过已移除路由创建的批次会保留并继续运行。它们与其他批次一样，通过 `/v1/batches` 和控制台列出、读取、取消、删除和下载（它们的 id"
" 以 `msgbatch_` 开头），形状如上：它们的结果是通用的结果行，不再是 `{\"custom_id\", \"result\"}` "
"行。它们结束时的 webhook 事件仍是 `message_batch.ended`，即它们创建时所用的事件；事件中的 id 可在 "
"`/v1/batches` 上使用。在已移除路由上使用过的 `Idempotency-Key` 不会通过 `/v1/batches` 重放。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:516
msgid ""
"The change to invalid requests needs care when migrating. The removed API"
" checked each request on its own: one with a bad parameter or a model you"
" may not use became an `errored` result and the rest of the batch ran. "
"`/v1/batches` checks every request first, for every target alike, and "
"refuses the whole batch when any request is invalid, before it makes any "
"inference call. A program that relied on submitting mixed good and bad "
"requests in one batch has to check its requests itself, or resubmit "
"without the request the error names."
msgstr ""
"迁移时需要注意无效请求的处理方式变了。已移除的 API 逐个检查请求：参数有误或使用了无权使用的模型的请求成为一条 `errored` "
"结果，批次的其余请求照常运行。`/v1/batches` "
"对所有目标一样，先检查全部请求，只要有一个无效就拒绝整个批次，此时还没有发出任何推理调用。依赖于在一个批次中混合提交有效和无效请求的程序，需要自己先检查请求，或者去掉错误中指出的请求后重新提交。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:524
msgid "Embeddings and Responses in a batch"
msgstr "批次中的 embedding 和 Responses"

#: ../developer/batches.md:526
msgid ""
"`/v1/embeddings` and `/v1/responses` can be batched like chat "
"completions, inline or from a file. A batched Responses request must be "
"independent: omit `store` or set it to `false`, and leave out "
"`previous_response_id`, `conversation`, `background` and `stream`. Hosted"
" tools, file inputs and any other field the gateway would have to drop "
"are refused."
msgstr ""
"`/v1/embeddings` 和 `/v1/responses` 可以像 chat completion "
"一样批量处理，内联或来自文件均可。批量的 Responses 请求必须是独立的：省略 `store` 或将其设为 `false`，并且不要带 "
"`previous_response_id`、`conversation`、`background` 和 "
"`stream`。托管工具、文件输入以及网关不得不丢弃的任何其他字段都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:532
msgid "Submitting safely twice"
msgstr "安全地重复提交"

#: ../developer/batches.md:534
msgid ""
"Send an `Idempotency-Key` header with a create call (either input method)"
" to make it safe to retry. The same key with the same request — for a "
"Messages batch, the same `anthropic-version` header too — returns the "
"batch the first call created, even if your quota has since run out or "
"your role changed; the same key with a different request answers `409`. "
"After the batch is deleted the key answers `410` for at least a day; a "
"key is remembered until a day after its batch ends. The key belongs to "
"your account, so any of your API keys can replay it, and a replay never "
"changes which key the batch runs under. The SDKs do not send this header "
"for you."
msgstr ""
"在创建调用中发送 `Idempotency-Key` 请求头（两种输入方式都可以），即可安全地重试。同一个键配同一个请求（Messages "
"批次还要求 `anthropic-version` "
"请求头相同）会返回第一次调用创建的批次，即使你的配额此后已用完或角色已变化；同一个键配不同的请求返回 `409`。批次删除后，该键至少一天内返回 "
"`410`；键会一直记住，直到其批次结束后一天。键属于你的账户，所以你的任何 API 密钥都能重放它，重放也绝不会改变批次运行所用的密钥。SDK "
"不会替你发送这个请求头。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:544
msgid "Costs"
msgstr "费用"

#: ../developer/batches.md:546
msgid ""
"Every attempt at a request is recorded with what it was billed, at the "
"same point and the same price as an interactive request; a batch is never"
" billed a second time on top. `cost_usd` adds up the attempts whose cost "
"is known."
msgstr "请求的每次尝试都会记录其计费金额，计费时点和价格与交互式请求相同；批次不会在此之外再计费一次。`cost_usd` 累加费用已知的尝试。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:550
msgid ""
"When an attempt's result was lost after the request had been sent — the "
"gateway timed out, or a worker stopped mid-request — the provider may "
"still have run and charged it. Its cost is then *unknown*: it is counted "
"in `cost_unknown_attempts` and left out of `cost_usd` rather than counted"
" as zero. A retried request may therefore have run more than once."
msgstr ""
"如果请求已经发出后，某次尝试的结果丢失了——网关超时，或 worker "
"在请求中途停止——供应商可能仍然运行并收了费。此时它的费用是*未知*的：计入 `cost_unknown_attempts`，并且不计入 "
"`cost_usd`，而不是按零计算。因此，重试过的请求可能运行了不止一次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:556
msgid "Webhooks"
msgstr "Webhook"

#: ../developer/batches.md:558
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Instead of polling, register one HTTPS endpoint for your batches with "
"`PUT /v1/batch_webhook` (`{\"url\": \"https://…\"}`), or on the console's"
" **Batches** page. The answer carries the signing secret, `whsec_…`, "
"once; send `\"rotate_secret\": true` to get a new one. `GET "
"/v1/batch_webhook` shows the webhook, `DELETE /v1/batch_webhook` removes "
"it, and `GET /v1/batch_webhook/events` lists recent deliveries."
msgstr ""
"不想轮询的话，可以用 `PUT /v1/batch_webhook`（`{\"url\": \"https://…\"}`）或在控制台的 "
"**Batches** 页面为你的批次注册一个 HTTPS 端点。返回中会附带签名密钥 `whsec_…`，只出现这一次；发送 "
"`\"rotate_secret\": true` 可以获取新密钥。`GET /v1/batch_webhook` 显示 "
"webhook，`DELETE /v1/batch_webhook` 删除它，`GET /v1/batch_webhook/events` "
"列出最近的投递记录。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:565
msgid ""
"Setting up a webhook, changing its URL, rotating its secret or turning it"
" back on needs the same role as creating a batch (`BATCH_MIN_ROLE`); "
"below it, `PUT` answers `403` and nothing is stored or looked up. The "
"check uses your role at the time of the request. If your role is lowered,"
" you can still read your webhook, list its deliveries and delete it, and "
"events for your existing batches are still delivered while it stays "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"设置 webhook、修改其 URL、轮换密钥或重新启用，都需要达到创建批次所需的角色（`BATCH_MIN_ROLE`）；角色不足时，`PUT`"
" 返回 `403`，不会存储配置或进行地址查询。检查使用请求时的当前角色。角色降低后，你仍可读取自己的 "
"webhook、查看投递记录和删除它；只要它仍启用，已有批次的事件也会继续投递。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:572
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When a batch ends, after its results can be read, the gateway POSTs an "
"event: `batch.completed`, `batch.failed`, `batch.expired` or "
"`batch.cancelled`, whatever the batch's target. A batch created through "
"the removed Message Batches API ends with `message_batch.ended` instead, "
"as it did when it was created; events already queued are delivered as "
"they were written. The body names the batch only (`{\"id\", \"object\": "
"\"event\", \"type\", \"created_at\", \"data\": {\"id\"}}`); fetch the "
"results with your API key. Deliveries are signed as Standard Webhooks "
"are: verify `webhook-signature` (`v1,` and a base64 HMAC-SHA256 of "
"`\"{webhook-id}.{webhook-timestamp}.{body}\"` with the secret's base64 "
"part as the key). A delivery that is not answered with a `2xx` is retried"
" with backoff, up to eight attempts; the same event can arrive more than "
"once, so deduplicate on `webhook-id`."
msgstr ""
"批次结束、其结果可读之后，网关会 POST "
"一个事件：`batch.completed`、`batch.failed`、`batch.expired` 或 "
"`batch.cancelled`，与批次的目标无关。通过已移除的 Message Batches API 创建的批次则以 "
"`message_batch.ended` 结束，与它创建时一样；已经排队的事件按写入时的样子投递。请求体只指明批次（`{\"id\", "
"\"object\": \"event\", \"type\", \"created_at\", \"data\": "
"{\"id\"}}`）；请用你的 API 密钥获取结果。投递按 Standard Webhooks 的方式签名：校验 `webhook-"
"signature`（`v1,` 加上以密钥的 base64 部分为 key、对 `\"{webhook-id}.{webhook-"
"timestamp}.{body}\"` 计算的 base64 HMAC-SHA256）。没有得到 `2xx` "
"回应的投递会带退避重试，最多八次；同一事件可能到达不止一次，请按 `webhook-id` 去重。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:585
msgid ""
"A webhook URL must be HTTPS and reach a public address. Private, "
"loopback, link-local and cloud-metadata addresses are refused when the "
"URL is saved, again on every redirect, and again on every connection."
msgstr ""
"webhook URL 必须是 HTTPS，且指向公网地址。私有地址、回环地址、链路本地地址和云元数据地址会在保存 URL "
"时、每次重定向时以及每次连接时被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:589
msgid "Batches in the console"
msgstr "控制台中的批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:591
msgid ""
"The **Batches** page of the console (from the dashboard) lists all your "
"batches — each with its name, target, model and input method, status, "
"requests by outcome, tokens and known cost — and lets you search them by "
"name or ID, filter them by status, open one for its details, cancel, "
"delete and download results, and set up your webhook."
msgstr ""
"控制台的 **Batches** "
"页面（从仪表盘进入）列出你的所有批次——每个批次的名称、目标、模型和输入方式、状态、按结果分类的请求数、token 和已知费用——并可以按名称或 "
"ID 搜索、按状态筛选、打开查看详情、取消、删除、下载结果，以及设置 webhook。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:597
msgid ""
"The dashboard's **Tools** link to it while `BATCH_ENABLED` is on and "
"either your role reaches `BATCH_MIN_ROLE` or you have batches or a "
"webhook of your own. With `BATCH_ENABLED` off there is no link, and the "
"page says that Batch is not available. Quotas and API keys play no part "
"in either."
msgstr ""
"当 `BATCH_ENABLED` 开启，且你的角色达到 `BATCH_MIN_ROLE` 或你有自己的批次或 webhook 时，仪表盘的 "
"**工具** 会链接到这个页面。`BATCH_ENABLED` 关闭时没有链接，页面会说明批量推理不可用。配额和 API 密钥不影响这两者。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:602
msgid ""
"Below `BATCH_MIN_ROLE` you cannot submit batches or change your webhook, "
"and the page says so; what you already have stays yours to manage: list "
"your batches, download their results, cancel and delete them, and read "
"and remove your webhook. The page then offers no **Create batch** button."
msgstr ""
"角色低于 `BATCH_MIN_ROLE` 时，你不能提交批次或修改 "
"webhook，页面会说明这一点；已有的内容仍归你管理：列出批次、下载结果、取消和删除批次，以及查看和移除 webhook。此时页面不提供 "
"**Create batch**（创建任务）按钮。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:607
msgid ""
"The console asks `GET /user/batch-capabilities` (signed-in session) for "
"this: `status` (`enabled`, `disabled`, or `unavailable` while the batch "
"store is not ready), `min_role`, `role_may_submit` (your role only, not "
"your quotas), `has_history` (null when it could not be checked; the link "
"then stays) and `show_entry`."
msgstr ""
"控制台通过 `GET /user/batch-"
"capabilities`（已登录会话）获取这些信息：`status`（`enabled`、`disabled`，或批次存储尚未就绪时的 "
"`unavailable`）、`min_role`、`role_may_submit`（只看你的角色，不看配额）、`has_history`（无法检查时为"
" null，此时链接保留）和 `show_entry`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:613
msgid "Creating a batch in the console"
msgstr "在控制台创建批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:615
msgid ""
"**Create batch** turns a JSONL file into a Chat Completions or Embeddings"
" batch in three steps; nothing runs until you confirm the last one:"
msgstr ""
"**Create batch**（创建任务）分三步把一个 JSONL 文件变成 Chat Completions 或 Embeddings "
"批次；确认最后一步之前，不会执行任何请求："

#: ../developer/batches.md:618
msgid ""
"**Upload data.** The file has the lines described in [Batches from a file"
"](#batches-from-a-file); `url` and `method` may be left out. The page "
"recognises the type from each line's `url`, or from the body when there "
"is none (`messages`: Chat; `input`: Embeddings). It asks you to choose "
"only when no line says. A file mixing both types, a `url` the body "
"contradicts, and any other endpoint are errors that no choice overrides."
msgstr ""
"**上传数据。** 文件的每一行如 [从文件创建批次](#batches-from-a-file) 所述；`url` 和 `method` "
"可以省略。页面根据每行的 `url` "
"识别类型，没有时根据请求体识别（`messages`：Chat；`input`：Embeddings）。只有没有任何一行说明类型时，才会请你选择。混合两种类型的文件、`url`"
" 与请求体相矛盾的行，以及其他任何 endpoint 都是错误，任何选择都不能绕过。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:624
msgid ""
"**Configure.** Give the batch a name, and optionally a description. Keep "
"the file's model, or choose one model for every request, which you must "
"do when the file names several models or one you cannot use. For Chat you"
" may also set `temperature` and `max_tokens` for every request. Every "
"other field is kept as the file has it."
msgstr ""
"**配置任务。** "
"为批次命名，并可选填写描述。可以沿用文件中的模型，也可以为所有请求统一选择一个模型；文件中有多个模型，或使用了你无权使用的模型时，必须统一选择。Chat"
" 还可以为所有请求统一设置 `temperature` 和 `max_tokens`。其他字段都按文件原样保留。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:629
msgid ""
"**Check and confirm.** The gateway checks every line without running or "
"billing anything. Each problem names its line, `custom_id` and field, "
"never the request's content, and the list can be downloaded as CSV or "
"JSONL. When the file is valid, the page shows the first stored requests, "
"the canonical model the batch will run on, its 24-hour window, how it is "
"billed and how long its results are kept."
msgstr ""
"**校验与确认。** 网关逐行检查文件，不执行也不计费。每个问题都给出行号、`custom_id` 和字段，从不回显请求内容；问题清单可以下载为 "
"CSV 或 JSONL。文件有效时，页面会展示存储的前几条请求、批次实际使用的规范模型、24 小时执行窗口、计费方式和结果的保留期。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:636
msgid ""
"The console is stricter than `/v1/batches`. A field the gateway would not"
" forward is an error rather than dropped silently: for example "
"`max_completion_tokens` (rename it to `max_tokens`) or `user`. So are a "
"byte-order mark, a key repeated within an object, and `NaN` or "
"`Infinity`. Fields such as `tools` and a JSON schema are passed on as "
"written. The stored requests name the canonical model, so a later change "
"to an alias does not move the batch to another model. The stored "
"requests, filled-in fields and overrides included, are held to the same "
"file size limit as an upload."
msgstr ""
"控制台比 `/v1/batches` 更严格。网关不会转发的字段会报错，而不是被悄悄丢弃，例如 "
"`max_completion_tokens`（请改为 `max_tokens`）或 "
"`user`。字节顺序标记（BOM）、同一对象内的重复键，以及 `NaN` 或 `Infinity` 也会报错。`tools`、JSON "
"Schema 这类字段按原样传递。存储的请求写入规范模型 "
"ID，因此之后修改别名也不会让批次改用其他模型。存储的请求（包括补上的字段和覆盖值）同样受上传文件大小上限的限制。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:645
msgid ""
"A batch created in the console runs under your active API key, as a batch"
" you submit with that key would. The page shows the key's prefix only and"
" never creates a key: without one you can upload and check files, and the"
" page links to the dashboard to create a key before you submit. Signing "
"out or closing the browser does not stop a submitted batch; revoking or "
"regenerating the key fails its unfinished requests. If the key, or the "
"model the choice resolves to, changes between the check and the "
"submission, the submission is refused and you check again. Uploading and "
"checking cost nothing, even with a daily quota of zero; submitting needs "
"quota left."
msgstr ""
"在控制台创建的批次以你当前有效的 API "
"密钥运行，与用这把密钥提交的批次相同。页面只显示密钥前缀，也不会替你创建密钥：没有密钥时仍可以上传和校验文件，页面会引导你到仪表盘先创建密钥再提交。退出登录或关闭浏览器不会停止已提交的批次；撤销或重新生成这把密钥会使其未结束的请求失败。如果在校验和提交之间密钥发生变化，或所选模型解析到了另一个模型，提交会被拒绝，需要重新校验。上传和校验不收费，每日额度为零时也可以进行；提交需要有剩余额度。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:655
msgid ""
"Each submission keeps its own `Idempotency-Key` in your browser until its"
" outcome is known. A timeout, a reload or a second tab therefore finds "
"the batch it created instead of creating another. When a submission's "
"answer never arrived and more than a day has passed, the page can no "
"longer be sure, so it stops and asks you: submitting again then makes a "
"new submission, which can create and bill a second batch. A request in a "
"batch may still be billed more than once when an attempt's result is "
"lost; see [Costs](#costs)."
msgstr ""
"每次提交都会在浏览器中保留自己的 `Idempotency-"
"Key`，直到结果确定。因此超时、刷新页面或另一个标签页都会找到它已创建的批次，而不会再创建一个。如果一次提交始终没有得到响应，且已经过去一天以上，页面无法再确定结果，会停下来询问你：此时再次提交是一次新的提交，可能会创建并计费第二个批次。批次中的单条请求在某次尝试的结果丢失时，仍可能被计费不止一次；参见"
" [费用](#costs)。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:663
msgid ""
"**Copy as new batch** opens the create page on a batch's source file and "
"settings, for a batch created in the console and for an API file batch of"
" target Chat or Embeddings whose input file is still stored. When that "
"file has been deleted or has expired, you upload it again and the "
"settings are kept. A batch of direct requests, or of target Messages or "
"Responses, cannot be copied yet. Copying runs nothing and does not extend"
" the file's retention."
msgstr ""
"**Copy as new batch**（复制为新任务）会用批次的源文件和设置打开创建页面，适用于在控制台创建的批次，以及目标为 Chat 或 "
"Embeddings、输入文件仍然保留的 API 文件批次。源文件已删除或过期时，重新上传即可，设置会保留。直接提交请求的批次，以及目标为 "
"Messages 或 Responses 的批次，暂不支持复制。复制不会执行任何请求，也不会延长文件的保留期。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:670
msgid ""
"Uploaded files are kept for `BATCH_FILE_RETENTION_DAYS`. **Uploaded "
"files** on the create page lists yours and deletes them; a batch already "
"submitted keeps running. When the settings change what is stored, the "
"batch keeps its own copy of the requests: it counts toward your storage "
"and is deleted with the batch or its source file."
msgstr ""
"上传的文件保留 `BATCH_FILE_RETENTION_DAYS` 天。创建页面上的 **Uploaded "
"files**（已上传文件）列出你的文件，并可以删除；已提交的批次会继续运行。设置改变了存储内容时，批次会保留一份自己的请求副本：它计入你的存储空间，并随批次或其源文件一起删除。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:676
msgid ""
"A finished Chat or Embeddings batch's details offer **Export unfinished "
"requests**: its failed, expired and cancelled requests as an input file, "
"to fix and submit as a new batch."
msgstr ""
"已结束的 Chat 或 Embeddings 批次的详情页提供 **Export unfinished "
"requests**（导出未成功请求）：把失败、过期未执行和已取消的请求导出为输入文件，修改后可作为新批次提交。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:680
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Limit"
msgstr "限制项"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Size of the create request's body"
msgstr "创建请求的请求体大小"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "32 MiB (`413` above it)"
msgstr "32 MiB（超过返回 `413`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Requests per batch"
msgstr "每个批次的请求数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "50,000"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Batches you may have unfinished at once (`validating`, `in_progress`, "
"`finalizing` or `cancelling`)"
msgstr "可同时保留的未完成批次数（`validating`、`in_progress`、`finalizing` 或 `cancelling`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "10 (`429` above it)"
msgstr "10（超过返回 `429`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Unfinished requests across all your batches"
msgstr "你所有批次中的未完成请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "100,000 (`429` above it)"
msgstr "100,000（超过返回 `429`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Size of an input file, and of one of its lines"
msgstr "输入文件及其单行的大小"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "32 MiB; 4 MiB per line"
msgstr "32 MiB；每行 4 MiB"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Input files you may keep, and upload per hour"
msgstr "你可以保留的输入文件总量，以及每小时上传数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "512 MiB; 60"
msgstr "512 MiB；60 个"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Time a batch has to start its pending requests (`completion_window`)"
msgstr "批次启动待处理请求的时间窗口（`completion_window`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "24 hours (always 24 hours for file batches)"
msgstr "24 小时（文件批次始终为 24 小时）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Time a finished batch is kept"
msgstr "已结束批次的保留时间"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "7 days"
msgstr "7 天"

#: ../developer/batches.md:693
msgid ""
"The operator may have changed any of them. A larger job is several "
"batches."
msgstr "运营方可能修改过其中任何一项。更大的任务请拆成多个批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:695
msgid "Errors from the create call"
msgstr "创建调用的错误"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "When"
msgstr "何时出现"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`400`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"The body is not valid JSON or not a batch; a request is invalid, uses an "
"unknown or auto model, or repeats a `custom_id`; too many requests; a "
"Messages batch without a known, allowed `anthropic-version` header, or "
"another batch with one; an `anthropic_version` field in the body; an "
"`anthropic-beta` header; or the request carries `X-On-Behalf-Of`"
msgstr ""
"请求体不是有效的 JSON 或不是批次；某个请求无效、使用了未知模型或 auto 模型，或 `custom_id` "
"重复；请求过多；Messages 批次没有已知且允许的 `anthropic-version` 请求头，或其他批次带有该请求头；请求体中有 "
"`anthropic_version` 字段；带有 `anthropic-beta` 请求头；或请求带有 `X-On-Behalf-Of`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`401`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"The API key is invalid or expired when authentication runs, or the "
"account becomes unavailable before the batch is stored"
msgstr "认证时 API key 无效或已过期，或在批次存储之前账户变得不可用"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`403`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Your role may not create batches"
msgstr "你的角色不能创建批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`404`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Batch inference is not available on this gateway"
msgstr "此网关不提供批量推理"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`409`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "The `Idempotency-Key` was already used with a different request"
msgstr "该 `Idempotency-Key` 已用于另一个不同的请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`410`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "The `Idempotency-Key`'s batch has been deleted"
msgstr "该 `Idempotency-Key` 对应的批次已被删除"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`413`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "The body is larger than the size limit"
msgstr "请求体超过大小限制"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`429`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"You have the most unfinished batches allowed, the batch would take your "
"unfinished requests over their limit, or your daily quota is used up"
msgstr "你的未完成批次已达上限、该批次会让你的未完成请求超过上限，或你的每日额度已用完"

#: ../developer/batches.md:708
msgid ""
"A file batch is counted against the limit on unfinished requests while "
"its file is read, after the create call has answered: over the limit, the"
" batch is `failed` with `queued_request_limit` in `errors`."
msgstr ""
"文件批次在创建调用返回之后、读取文件期间才计入未完成请求上限：超出上限时，批次会 `failed`，`errors` 中带有 "
"`queued_request_limit`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:712
msgid "Compared with OpenAI's batch API"
msgstr "与 OpenAI Batch API 的比较"

#: ../developer/batches.md:714
msgid ""
"Batch requests cost the same as interactive ones: there is no batch "
"discount, and the gateway runs each request itself rather than handing "
"the batch to a provider's own batch service."
msgstr "批量请求与交互式请求价格相同：没有批量折扣，网关自己运行每个请求，而不是把批次交给供应商自己的批量服务。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:717
msgid ""
"The limits are the deployment's (see [Limits](#limits)), lower than the "
"providers' own: 50,000 requests and 32 MiB per batch by default."
msgstr "限制由部署决定（见[限制](#limits)），低于供应商自己的限制：默认每个批次 50,000 个请求、32 MiB。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:719
msgid ""
"The 24-hour window of file batches is when the gateway stops *starting* "
"requests. Requests already running when it ends finish, so a batch may "
"reach its final status after `expires_at`."
msgstr ""
"文件批次的 24 小时窗口是网关停止*开始*请求的时间。窗口结束时已在运行的请求会运行完，所以批次可能在 `expires_at` "
"之后才进入最终状态。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:722
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Direct requests, `GET /v1/batches/{id}/results`, the JSONL export, "
"`DELETE /v1/batches/{id}`, `Idempotency-Key`, the Messages target with "
"its `anthropic-version` header, and the cost fields are this gateway's "
"own. OpenAI's file flow is compatible for the chat, embeddings and "
"Responses targets."
msgstr ""
"直接提交请求、`GET /v1/batches/{id}/results`、JSONL 导出、`DELETE /v1/batches/{id"
"}`、`Idempotency-Key`、带 `anthropic-version` 请求头的 Messages "
"目标以及费用字段都是本网关自有的。OpenAI 的文件方式对 Chat、Embeddings 和 Responses 目标兼容。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:726
msgid "Only `purpose=batch` files exist, and they serve batches only."
msgstr "只存在 `purpose=batch` 的文件，且它们只用于批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:727
msgid ""
"Responses requests in a batch are independent: `store: true`, "
"`previous_response_id`, `conversation`, `background` and hosted tools are"
" refused."
msgstr ""
"批次中的 Responses 请求是独立的：`store: "
"true`、`previous_response_id`、`conversation`、`background` 和托管工具会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:730
msgid ""
"Messages batches belong to your account; there are no workspaces. Betas, "
"server tools, Files API sources, MCP servers and containers are refused. "
"Messages requests run through the gateway's own routing, not a provider's"
" batch service."
msgstr ""
"Messages 批次属于你的账户；没有 workspace。betas、服务端工具、Files API 来源、MCP 服务器和 "
"container 都会被拒绝。Messages 请求通过网关自己的路由运行，而不是供应商的批处理服务。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:735
msgid "Running batch inference"
msgstr "运行批量推理"

#: ../developer/batches.md:737
msgid ""
"These settings are on the admin console's **Configuration** tab, under "
"**Batch inference**. None needs a restart: a change applies to the next "
"request and to the worker's next round."
msgstr ""
"这些设置项位于管理控制台 **Configuration** 标签页的 **Batch inference** "
"下。都不需要重启：修改会作用于下一个请求和 worker 的下一轮。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "on"
msgstr "开"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Serve batch inference, every kind of it. Off, every batch, file and "
"webhook route answers `404` and no queued request starts; stored batches "
"are kept"
msgstr "提供所有类型的批量推理。关闭时，所有批次、文件和 webhook 路由都返回 `404`，排队中的请求不会开始执行；已存储的批次会保留"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_MIN_ROLE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`internal`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Lowest role that may create batches, upload files and set up a batch "
"webhook (`free`, `pro`, `internal`, `admin`). A queued request also waits"
" while its owner's role is below it"
msgstr ""
"允许创建批次、上传文件和设置批次 webhook "
"的最低角色（`free`、`pro`、`internal`、`admin`）。排队中的请求在其所有者的角色低于该门槛时也会等待"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_MODEL_CONCURRENCY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "64"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Batch requests a model runs at once, across the whole deployment, when it"
" has no cap of its own. `0` pauses batch work on those models"
msgstr "模型没有自己的上限时，它在整个部署中同时运行的批量请求数。`0` 会暂停这些模型上的批量任务"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_YIELD_TO_INTERACTIVE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Interactive requests in flight on a model take batch slots from its cap, "
"so batch work gives way to interactive traffic on the same model. Off, "
"batch work fills the cap whatever the interactive load, and "
"`BATCH_SHARED_INTERACTIVE_LOAD` and `BATCH_INTERACTIVE_RESERVE` have no "
"effect"
msgstr ""
"模型上正在处理的交互式请求会占用其上限中的批量名额，因此批量任务会为同一模型上的交互式流量让路。关闭后，无论交互负载如何，批量任务都会占满上限，`BATCH_SHARED_INTERACTIVE_LOAD`"
" 和 `BATCH_INTERACTIVE_RESERVE` 也不再起作用"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_REQUESTS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "50000"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Requests one batch may hold"
msgstr "一个批次可以包含的请求数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_BODY_MB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "32"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Largest create request, in MiB"
msgstr "创建请求的最大大小，单位 MiB"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_ACTIVE_PER_USER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "10"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Unfinished batches one user may have"
msgstr "一个用户可以有的未完成批次数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_COMPLETION_WINDOW_HOURS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "24"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Hours a new batch has before its unstarted requests expire, 1–168"
msgstr "新批次中未开始的请求过期前的小时数，1–168"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_RETENTION_DAYS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "7"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Days a finished batch and its results are kept. A batch keeps the value "
"it was created with"
msgstr "已结束批次及其结果的保留天数。批次保留创建时的取值"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_QUEUED_REQUESTS_PER_USER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "100000"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Unfinished requests one user may have across all their batches"
msgstr "一个用户在其所有批次中可以有的未完成请求数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_ROLE_CONCURRENCY_FREE` / `_PRO` / `_INTERNAL` / `_ADMIN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "8 / 16 / 64 / 64"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Batch requests one user of that role may have running at once, across "
"every model. Counted in each gateway process on its own, so with several "
"processes a user may run up to this many in each; a model's cap, by "
"contrast, is counted in the database across every process. Separate from "
"the role's interactive concurrency limit (`user_concurrency_<role>` and a"
" user's own override apply to interactive requests only); `0` removes "
"this cap"
msgstr ""
"该角色的一个用户在所有模型上同时运行的批量请求数。每个网关进程各自计数，所以有多个进程时，一个用户在每个进程中都可以运行这么多；相比之下，模型上限在数据库中跨所有进程计数。它独立于该角色的交互式并发上限（`user_concurrency_<role>`"
" 和用户自己的覆盖值只作用于交互式请求）；`0` 取消这一上限"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_SHARED_INTERACTIVE_LOAD`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Yield to the interactive requests of every gateway process, not only the "
"worker's own. While the shared counts cannot be read from the database, "
"no new batch request starts; running ones continue. Applies only while "
"`BATCH_YIELD_TO_INTERACTIVE` is on"
msgstr ""
"让位于所有网关进程的交互式请求，而不只是 worker 所在进程的。无法从数据库读取共享计数时，不会启动新的批量请求；正在运行的请求继续。只在 "
"`BATCH_YIELD_TO_INTERACTIVE` 开启时生效"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_INTERACTIVE_RESERVE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "0"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Slots of every model's batch cap kept free for interactive requests, on "
"top of those in flight. Applies only while `BATCH_YIELD_TO_INTERACTIVE` "
"is on"
msgstr ""
"每个模型的批量上限中，在正在处理的交互式请求之外，再为交互式请求预留的名额数。只在 `BATCH_YIELD_TO_INTERACTIVE` "
"开启时生效"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_LINE_KB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "4096"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Largest line of an input file"
msgstr "输入文件的最大单行大小"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_RESULT_KB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Largest response one batch request may store"
msgstr "单个批量请求可以存储的最大响应"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_FILES_MAX_TOTAL_MB_PER_USER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "512"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Uploaded input files one user may keep"
msgstr "一个用户可以保留的已上传输入文件总量"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_FILE_UPLOADS_PER_HOUR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "60"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Input files one user may upload per hour"
msgstr "一个用户每小时可以上传的输入文件数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_FILE_RETENTION_DAYS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "30"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Days an uploaded input file is kept"
msgstr "已上传输入文件的保留天数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_ANTHROPIC_VERSIONS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`2023-06-01,2026-10-21`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"`anthropic-version` values a new `/v1/messages` batch may name. A stored "
"batch keeps running under its own, and a create it made still replays"
msgstr ""
"新的 `/v1/messages` 批次可以使用的 `anthropic-version` "
"值。已存的批次继续按它自己的版本运行，它创建时的请求仍可重放"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`BATCH_WEBHOOK_ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "off"
msgstr "关"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"Let webhooks reach private and loopback addresses. For isolated test "
"deployments only"
msgstr "允许 webhook 访问私有地址和回环地址。仅用于隔离的测试部署"

#: ../developer/batches.md:764
msgid ""
"`BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED`, which earlier versions used to hold back file "
"batches, Message Batches, embedding and Responses batches and webhooks, "
"no longer controls anything. A value left in the environment or the "
"database changes nothing, is not listed on the Settings tab and cannot be"
" set there; the gateway keeps it, so that a rollback to a release that "
"still implements it (#1660 up to, but not including, #1673) reads it "
"again, and warns about it once at startup. Once no such release will run,"
" delete the stored row (`DELETE /admin/config/BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED`, "
"or `python -m serving.config.manage reset BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED`) and "
"unset the variable."
msgstr ""
"早期版本用 `BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED` 控制文件批次、Message Batches、嵌入和 Responses 批次以及"
" webhook，现在它已不再生效。环境变量或数据库中遗留的值不会改变任何行为，也不会在 Settings "
"页列出，且不能再通过该页设置；网关会保留它，以便回滚到仍实现该开关的版本（#1660 起、#1673 "
"之前）时重新读取，并在启动时发出一次警告。确认不再运行任何这样的版本后，删除已存储的记录（`DELETE "
"/admin/config/BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED`，或 `python -m serving.config.manage"
" reset BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED`），并移除对应环境变量。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:775
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A model's own cap is set in **Batch Concurrency** on the admin Settings "
"tab: empty takes `BATCH_MODEL_CONCURRENCY`, `0` pauses that model's batch"
" work, and the section shows how many batch requests each model is "
"running and how many are queued. A change reaches every gateway process "
"within about ten seconds. Behind it are `GET /admin/batch/models` and "
"`PATCH /admin/batch/models/{model_id}` with `{\"max_concurrency\": <n or "
"null>}`. The cap counts the requests of every gateway process against one"
" limit, so it does not grow with the number of processes."
msgstr ""
"模型自己的上限在管理后台 Settings 标签页的 **Batch Concurrency** 中设置：留空则使用 "
"`BATCH_MODEL_CONCURRENCY`，`0` "
"暂停该模型的批量任务；该区域还显示每个模型正在运行和排队的批量请求数。修改会在大约十秒内到达所有网关进程。其背后是 `GET "
"/admin/batch/models` 和 `PATCH /admin/batch/models/{model_id}`（请求体 "
"`{\"max_concurrency\": <n or null>}`）。该上限把所有网关进程的请求计入同一个限额，所以不会随进程数增加而变大。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:784
msgid ""
"Every gateway process runs a worker; requests of one batch may run in "
"several of them. A process that stops hands its unfinished requests back,"
" and the requests of one that dies are taken over by another once their "
"lease runs out, a few minutes later."
msgstr ""
"每个网关进程都运行一个 "
"worker；同一批次的请求可能在其中多个进程里运行。正常停止的进程会交还未完成的请求；意外退出的进程，其请求会在租约到期后（几分钟后）由其他进程接管。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:789
msgid ""
"The batches live in the operational database: `batch_jobs`, "
"`batch_items`, `batch_attempts` (one row per attempt, with what it was "
"billed), `batch_idempotency`, `batch_files` and `batch_file_chunks`, "
"`batch_webhooks` and `batch_webhook_events`, `batch_model_limits`, the "
"worker's scheduling state in `batch_user_state` and "
"`batch_interactive_load`, and download leases in `batch_read_leases`. "
"Each request a batch runs is a row in `api_logs` with `batch_job_id` set,"
" and its item and attempt in the row's metadata. Permanently deleting a "
"user deletes their batches, files, idempotency records and webhook too."
msgstr ""
"批次存放在运行数据存储中：`batch_jobs`、`batch_items`、`batch_attempts`（每次尝试一行，含计费金额）、`batch_idempotency`、`batch_files`"
" 和 `batch_file_chunks`、`batch_webhooks` 和 "
"`batch_webhook_events`、`batch_model_limits`，worker 的调度状态在 "
"`batch_user_state` 和 `batch_interactive_load` 中，下载租约在 `batch_read_leases`"
" 中。批次运行的每个请求都是 `api_logs` 中设置了 `batch_job_id` 的一行，其条目和尝试记录在该行的 metadata "
"中。永久删除用户时，也会删除其批次、文件、幂等记录和 webhook。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:798
msgid ""
"The admin console's **Batches** tab lists every user's batches, totals "
"them per user and lets an administrator cancel one."
msgstr "管理控制台的 **Batches** 标签页列出所有用户的批次，按用户汇总，并允许管理员取消批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:801
msgid "Upgrading a deployment"
msgstr "升级部署"

#: ../developer/batches.md:803
msgid ""
"A worker only runs the kinds of batch it knows: claims, expiry, "
"finalizing, validation, sealing and cleanup all filter, in the database "
"query itself, on a batch's surface, target and schema version. That "
"filter is what makes a rolling upgrade safe, and it exists from #1660 on:"
" **a rolling upgrade is supported from a release that includes #1660.** "
"Its workers skip the Messages batches this version creates through "
"`/v1/batches`, inline or from a file, so while they still run only this "
"version's workers run, validate, seal or expire those. While both "
"versions run:"
msgstr ""
"worker 只运行它认识的批次种类：领取、过期、收尾、校验、封存和清理都在数据库查询中按批次的 surface、target 和 schema "
"version 过滤。正是这一过滤让滚动升级是安全的，它从 #1660 起才有：**滚动升级只支持从包含 #1660 的版本开始**。这些 "
"worker 会跳过本版本通过 `/v1/batches` 创建的 Messages 批次（直接提交或来自文件），所以它们还在运行时，只有本版本的"
" worker 会运行、校验、封存或过期这些批次。两个版本同时运行时："

#: ../developer/batches.md:812
msgid ""
"a create for the Messages target that an old process happens to answer is"
" refused with `400` (it does not know the target); retry it, or wait "
"until every process runs this version;"
msgstr "恰好由旧进程处理的 Messages 目标创建请求会得到 `400`（旧进程不认识该目标）；请重试，或等到所有进程都运行本版本；"

#: ../developer/batches.md:815
msgid ""
"an old process ignores an `anthropic-version` header or "
"`anthropic_version` field on a non-Messages batch, which this version "
"refuses;"
msgstr ""
"旧进程会忽略非 Messages 批次上的 `anthropic-version` 请求头或 `anthropic_version` "
"字段，而本版本会拒绝；"

#: ../developer/batches.md:817
msgid ""
"an old process still serves `/v1/messages/batches`, where this version "
"answers `410`; batches created there are drained by this version as "
"described in [Moving from Message Batches](#moving-from-message-batches)."
msgstr ""
"旧进程仍提供 `/v1/messages/batches`，本版本对这些路由返回 `410`；在旧进程上创建的批次由本版本按[从 Message "
"Batches 迁移](#moving-from-message-batches)中所述的方式排空。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:821
msgid ""
"A release that has a batch worker but not #1660 has no such filter: it "
"would run any batch it finds, Messages batches included, as chat "
"completions. Nothing this version stores, and no check it makes at "
"startup, can change what such a process already running does, or even "
"tell that one is running. Upgrade from such a release only with every old"
" process stopped, and when you do not know which release every process "
"runs, assume this case:"
msgstr ""
"有 batch worker 但不包含 #1660 的版本没有这种过滤：它会把找到的任何批次（包括 Messages "
"批次）当作聊天补全运行。本版本存储的任何内容、启动时做的任何检查，都无法改变这样一个已在运行的进程的行为，甚至无法察觉它在运行。从这样的版本升级时，只能在所有旧进程都停止的情况下进行；如果不知道各进程运行的是哪个版本，也按这种情况处理："

#: ../developer/batches.md:828
msgid ""
"On the old version, turn `BATCH_ENABLED` off (Settings tab, or `python -m"
" serving.config.manage set BATCH_ENABLED false`). Its workers read the "
"setting every round: within about ten seconds every old process stops "
"claiming and sweeping, and logs that its batch worker is disabled. A "
"request it was already running finishes or is handed back; those are chat"
" batches, which the new version runs too."
msgstr ""
"在旧版本上关闭 `BATCH_ENABLED`（Settings 页，或 `python -m serving.config.manage set"
" BATCH_ENABLED false`）。它的 worker "
"每一轮都会读取这个设置：大约十秒内，每个旧进程都会停止领取和清理，并在日志中记录其批次 worker "
"已禁用。它已经在运行的请求会运行完或交还；那些都是聊天批次，新版本也会运行。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:834
msgid ""
"Stop every gateway process of the old version, every replica and worker, "
"and keep them stopped: turn off whatever would start one again on its own"
" (restart policies, autoscaling, health-check replacement, deploy jobs)."
msgstr ""
"停止旧版本的所有 gateway 进程，包括所有副本和 "
"worker，并保持停止：关闭任何会自动重新启动它们的机制（重启策略、自动扩缩容、健康检查替换、部署任务）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:837
msgid ""
"Confirm that none is left with your orchestrator's own identity of each "
"process: its image, revision, release or deployment id. A database "
"session's client address does not show which version holds it — NAT, "
"shared hosts and connection poolers all hide that — and the health "
"endpoint does not either."
msgstr ""
"用编排系统自己对每个进程的身份确认已没有旧进程：它的镜像、revision、release 或 deployment "
"id。数据库会话的客户端地址说明不了是哪个版本持有它——NAT、共享主机和连接池都会掩盖这一点——健康检查端点也一样。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:842
msgid ""
"Wait for the database to finish their work: no session of the gateway's "
"database user is left (the query in step 5 of [Rolling back](#rolling-"
"back))."
msgstr "等待数据库处理完它们的工作：gateway 数据库用户已没有任何会话（[回滚](#rolling-back)第 5 步中的查询）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:845
msgid "Start this version. It keeps `BATCH_ENABLED` off, as step 1 stored it."
msgstr "启动本版本。它会保持 `BATCH_ENABLED` 关闭，即第 1 步存下的状态。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:846
msgid ""
"Once only this version runs, confirmed as in step 3, turn `BATCH_ENABLED`"
" on."
msgstr "确认只剩本版本运行后（按第 3 步的方式确认），开启 `BATCH_ENABLED`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:849
msgid ""
"Upgrading from a version without `BATCH_ROLE_CONCURRENCY_<ROLE>` changes "
"three things:"
msgstr "从没有 `BATCH_ROLE_CONCURRENCY_<ROLE>` 的版本升级，会带来三处变化："

#: ../developer/batches.md:852
msgid ""
"`BATCH_MODEL_CONCURRENCY` now defaults to 64, but a value stored for it "
"on the **Configuration** tab still applies. A deployment that saved the "
"old default of 4 keeps 4 until an administrator changes it."
msgstr ""
"`BATCH_MODEL_CONCURRENCY` 的默认值现在是 64，但在 **Configuration** "
"标签页为它存储的值仍然生效。保存过旧默认值 4 的部署会一直使用 4，直到管理员修改它。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:855
msgid ""
"`BATCH_USER_MAX_CONCURRENCY` no longer exists. A value stored for it is "
"ignored; `BATCH_ROLE_CONCURRENCY_<ROLE>` is the per-user batch limit."
msgstr ""
"`BATCH_USER_MAX_CONCURRENCY` "
"已不存在。为它存储的值会被忽略；`BATCH_ROLE_CONCURRENCY_<ROLE>` 就是每用户的批量上限。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:857
msgid ""
"`user_concurrency_<role>` and a user's own concurrency override no longer"
" limit batch requests."
msgstr "`user_concurrency_<role>` 和用户自己的并发覆盖值不再限制批量请求。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:860
msgid "Rolling back"
msgstr "回滚"

#: ../developer/batches.md:862
msgid ""
"Whatever version you roll back to, drain with this version the batches "
"that version cannot run, and start it only once every process of this "
"version has stopped and the database shows none left. Which batches those"
" are depends on the version, and so does the query that lists them (the "
"*drain query* below):"
msgstr "无论回滚到哪个版本，都要先由当前版本排空那个版本无法运行的批次，并且只有在当前版本的所有进程都已停止、数据库确认没有剩余之后，才能启动它。需要排空哪些批次取决于目标版本，列出它们的查询也随之不同（下文称为*排空查询*）："

#: ../developer/batches.md:867
msgid ""
"To a version that already has file batches and the former Message Batches"
" (#1660 or later): the Messages batches created through `/v1/batches`. "
"That version neither runs nor expires them, though it can still cancel "
"and delete them."
msgstr ""
"回滚到已经有文件批次和原 Message Batches 的版本（#1660 或之后）：需要排空通过 `/v1/batches` 创建的 "
"Messages 批次。那个版本既不运行也不过期它们，但仍可以取消和删除。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:877
msgid ""
"To an older version (before #1660): every batch that is not an inline "
"chat batch. That version would run them as chat completions."
msgstr "回滚到更早的版本（#1660 之前）：需要排空所有非内联聊天批次。那个版本会把它们当作聊天补全执行。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:887
msgid ""
"Either way, one empty drain query is not enough while a process of this "
"version is still running: a create admitted a moment before can still "
"store a new batch. Follow every step:"
msgstr "无论哪种情况，只要当前版本还有进程在运行，排空查询一次为空都不够：片刻之前已通过准入的创建请求仍可能写入新批次。请完成以下每一步："

#: ../developer/batches.md:891
msgid ""
"Set `BATCH_MIN_ROLE` to `admin`, so no one else can create batches, and "
"create none yourself. Other users' queued requests then stop starting "
"too, so their batches have to be cancelled rather than waited for. To let"
" them finish instead, skip this step; step 6 still catches a batch "
"created meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"将 `BATCH_MIN_ROLE` 设为 "
"`admin`，阻止其他用户创建批次，你自己也不要创建。其他用户排队中的请求也会停止启动，因此必须取消这些批次，不能只是等待它们完成。如果希望它们正常完成，可以跳过这一步；第"
" 6 步仍会发现期间新建的批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:896
msgid ""
"Cancel (or let finish) every batch the drain query lists: the admin "
"**Batches** tab lists and cancels anyone's. A cancelled file batch still "
"needs a moment to seal. Wait until the drain query returns no rows."
msgstr ""
"取消排空查询列出的每个批次，或等待它们完成：管理后台的 **Batches** "
"页可以列出并取消任何用户的批次。文件批次取消后仍需要一点时间完成封存。等待排空查询不再返回任何行。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:900
msgid ""
"Turn `BATCH_ENABLED` off. New batch requests now answer `404`, but a "
"request that had already passed its checks may still be on its way to the"
" database, so an empty result at this point proves nothing yet."
msgstr ""
"关闭 `BATCH_ENABLED`。新的批次请求现在会返回 "
"`404`，但已经通过检查的请求仍可能正在写入数据库，因此此时查询为空还不足以证明安全。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:903
msgid ""
"Stop every gateway process of this version, every replica and worker, and"
" keep them stopped: turn off whatever would start one again on its own "
"(restart policies, autoscaling, health-check replacement, deploy jobs) "
"for as long as the final check takes. Do not start any process of the "
"older version yet."
msgstr ""
"停止当前版本的所有网关进程、所有副本和 "
"worker，并保持停止状态：在最终检查完成前，关闭所有可能自动拉起进程的机制（重启策略、自动扩缩容、健康检查替换和部署任务）。此时不要启动任何旧版本进程。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:908
msgid ""
"Confirm the database has finished with them: no session of the gateway's "
"database user is left, so every transaction those processes opened has "
"committed or rolled back. Run this as a different user, or in your own "
"session, which the query leaves out; it must return no rows:"
msgstr "确认数据库已完成这些进程留下的工作：网关数据库用户的会话必须全部退出，这样这些进程开启的所有事务才都已提交或回滚。用另一个用户执行以下查询，或在自己的会话中执行（查询会排除该会话）；结果必须为空："

#: ../developer/batches.md:921
msgid ""
"A session can outlive its process: the server may still be finishing a "
"query or commit that was already sent, or not yet have noticed that the "
"connection is gone. Wait for it to end. If a session stays and you have "
"confirmed its host no longer runs a gateway, `pg_terminate_backend(pid)` "
"ends it and rolls back its open transaction."
msgstr ""
"会话可能比进程存活得更久：数据库服务端可能仍在完成已发送的查询或提交，也可能尚未发现连接已断开。应等待会话结束。如果某个会话一直存在，且已确认其所在主机不再运行网关，可用"
" `pg_terminate_backend(pid)` 终止它并回滚尚未完成的事务。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:926
msgid ""
"Only then run the drain query again. Only if it returns no rows, start "
"the older version. It keeps `BATCH_ENABLED` off; turn it on, and set "
"`BATCH_MIN_ROLE` back, once only the older version runs."
msgstr ""
"只有这时，才再次执行排空查询。只有结果为空，才能启动旧版本。旧版本仍会保持 `BATCH_ENABLED` "
"关闭；确认只剩旧版本运行后，再开启它，并恢复 `BATCH_MIN_ROLE`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:930
msgid ""
"Why the last check waits until the database is quiet: turning "
"`BATCH_ENABLED` off refuses new requests, but it does not stop a create "
"that was admitted a moment earlier; that create still stores its batch, "
"however long its body or the database takes. A process having exited is "
"not enough either, since a commit it sent may still be in progress on the"
" server. Each create is one transaction and only gateway processes write "
"batches, so once no gateway session is left and none can start, every "
"create has either committed or rolled back, and the query sees everything"
" that will ever be there."
msgstr ""
"最终检查必须等数据库活动结束，是因为关闭 `BATCH_ENABLED` "
"只会拒绝新请求，不会阻止刚刚通过准入检查的创建请求；无论读取请求体或访问数据库耗时多久，该请求仍会存储批次。仅确认进程已退出也不够，因为它之前发送的提交可能仍在服务端执行。每次创建都在一个事务内完成，而且只有网关进程会写入批次；因此，当所有网关会话都已退出且不会再启动时，每次创建必定已经提交或回滚，查询才能看到全部最终写入的数据。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:939
msgid ""
"If step 6 returns rows, do not start the older version: one before #1660 "
"would run them as chat completions, and a later one would leave them "
"unrun for good. Start this version again, and only this version, turn "
"`BATCH_ENABLED` on so its worker can run or seal those batches, cancel "
"them or let them finish (step 2), then repeat steps 3 to 6. Turning "
"`BATCH_ENABLED` off is not enough on its own: it stops this version's "
"worker too, so those batches would never drain."
msgstr ""
"如果第 6 步仍返回记录，不要启动旧版本：#1660 "
"之前的版本会把它们当作聊天补全执行，之后的版本则会让它们永远不运行。重新启动当前版本，且只运行当前版本；开启 `BATCH_ENABLED`，让 "
"worker 能够执行或封存这些批次，取消它们或等待它们完成（第 2 步），再重复第 3 至第 6 步。只关闭 `BATCH_ENABLED` "
"是不够的：它也会让当前版本的 worker 停止，这些批次就永远无法排空。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:946
msgid "What the older version does once it runs:"
msgstr "旧版本运行后的行为："

#: ../developer/batches.md:948
msgid ""
"A release that still implements `BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED` (from #1660 up "
"to, but not including, #1673, which retired it) reads it again, off by "
"default, so creating its newer batch kinds is refused until it is turned "
"on; batches already accepted keep running. From #1673 on the setting "
"controls nothing, as in this version."
msgstr ""
"仍实现 `BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED` 的版本（#1660 起，到移除它的 #1673 "
"之前）会重新读取它，默认关闭，因此在开启之前，它较新的批次种类无法创建；已接受的批次继续运行。从 #1673 "
"起，该设置与当前版本一样不再控制任何功能。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:953
msgid ""
"Any release from #1660 on serves `/v1/messages/batches` again, and shows "
"there only the batches stored through it."
msgstr "#1660 及之后的任何版本都会重新提供 `/v1/messages/batches`，并且只在那里显示通过它存储的批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:955
msgid ""
"Rows are never rewritten by a rollback: finished batches of the newer "
"kinds stay in the database. A version before #1660 lists and purges them "
"as if they were inline chat batches, and leaves uploaded files and "
"webhooks unread until the next upgrade."
msgstr ""
"回滚不会改写任何行：较新种类中已结束的批次仍留在数据库中。#1660 "
"之前的版本会把它们当作内联聊天批次列出和清理，并且直到下次升级前都不会读取已上传的文件和 webhook。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:597
msgid ""
"The page groups the statuses into four, for both the badge and the "
"filter; the `status` of `/v1/batches` is unchanged."
msgstr "页面把状态归为四类，徽标和筛选都使用这四类；`/v1/batches` 的 `status` 不变。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Shown as"
msgstr "显示为"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "Statuses"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "**Processing**"
msgstr "**处理中**"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"`validating`, `in_progress`, `finalizing` or `cancelling`; a short note "
"says which stage, and that running requests still finish while cancelling"
msgstr ""
"`validating`、`in_progress`、`finalizing` 或 "
"`cancelling`；简短说明会写明所处阶段，取消中时正在执行的请求仍会完成"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "**Completed**"
msgstr "**已完成**"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`completed`, and every request succeeded"
msgstr "`completed`，且所有请求都成功"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "**With issues**"
msgstr "**有异常**"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"`failed`, `expired` (the execution window ran out before every request "
"started), or `completed` with a request that did not succeed"
msgstr "`failed`、`expired`（执行窗口结束时仍有请求未开始），或 `completed` 但有请求未成功"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "**Cancelled**"
msgstr "**已取消**"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid "`cancelled`, whatever its requests did before the cancel"
msgstr "`cancelled`，无论取消前请求的结果如何"

#: ../developer/batches.md:607
msgid ""
"A paused batch stays **Processing**, with a note saying why. Results can "
"be downloaded only once the batch has finished, whatever it is shown as."
msgstr "暂停的批次仍显示为 **处理中**，并附说明原因。无论显示为哪一类，只有批次结束后才能下载结果。"

