#~ "names its `anthropic_version` in the "
#~ "create call, and every line is "
#~ "checked under it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "每一行是 `{\"custom_id\", \"method\": \"POST\", "
#~ "\"url\", \"body\"}`，其中 `url` 必须等于批次的 "
#~ "`endpoint`。每一行必须使用同一个模型。`/v1/messages` 的文件批次还要在创建调用中给出 "
#~ "`anthropic_version`，每一行都按它校验。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A batch whose target is `/v1/messages`"
#~ " carries Anthropic Messages request bodies"
#~ " and names the Anthropic API version"
#~ " they are written for in its "
#~ "`anthropic_version` field, beside `requests` "
#~ "or `input_file_id`:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "目标为 `/v1/messages` 的批次携带 Anthropic Messages"
#~ " 请求体，并在 `anthropic_version` 字段中给出这些请求所针对的 "
#~ "Anthropic API 版本，与 `requests` 或 "
#~ "`input_file_id` 并列："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "From a file, every line has "
