#~ msgid ""
#~ "`anthropic_version` is required for a "
#~ "Messages batch, and refused on any "
#~ "other. `2023-06-01` and `2026-10-21` are "
#~ "known; the operator chooses which of "
#~ "them new batches may use "
#~ "(`BATCH_ANTHROPIC_VERSIONS`). A batch keeps "
#~ "its version, and every request is "
#~ "checked, and runs, under it: under "
#~ "`2026-10-21`, `temperature`, `top_p` and "
#~ "`top_k` are refused, as are document "
#~ "blocks in assistant messages and "
#~ "citations on user text."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Messages 批次必须提供 `anthropic_version`，其他批次提供会被拒绝。已知的版本是 "
#~ "`2023-06-01` 和 "
#~ "`2026-10-21`；运营者决定新批次可以使用其中哪些（`BATCH_ANTHROPIC_VERSIONS`）。批次保留它的版本，每个请求都按该版本校验和运行：在"
#~ " `2026-10-21` 下，`temperature`、`top_p` 和 `top_k`"
#~ " 会被拒绝，assistant 消息中的 document 块和 user "
#~ "文本上的 citations 也会被拒绝。"

#~ msgid ""
