#~ msgid ""
#~ "Batches created through the removed "
#~ "routes are kept and still run. "
#~ "They are listed, read, cancelled, "
#~ "deleted and downloaded through `/v1/batches`"
#~ " and the console like any other "
#~ "batch (their ids start with "
#~ "`msgbatch_`), in the shapes above: their"
#~ " results come as the common result"
#~ " lines, no longer as `{\"custom_id\", "
#~ "\"result\"}` lines. An `Idempotency-Key` "
#~ "used on the removed routes does "
#~ "not replay through `/v1/batches`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "通过已移除路由创建的批次会保留并继续运行。它们与其他批次一样，通过 `/v1/batches` "
#~ "和控制台列出、读取、取消、删除和下载（它们的 id 以 `msgbatch_` "
#~ "开头），形状如上：它们的结果是通用的结果行，不再是 `{\"custom_id\", \"result\"}`"
#~ " 行。在已移除路由上使用过的 `Idempotency-Key` 不会通过 "
#~ "`/v1/batches` 重放。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Send an `Idempotency-Key` header with"
#~ " a create call (either input method)"
#~ " to make it safe to retry. The"
#~ " same key with the same request "
#~ "— for a Messages batch, the same"
#~ " `anthropic_version` too — returns the "
#~ "batch the first call created, even "
#~ "if your quota has since run out"
#~ " or your role changed; the same "
#~ "key with a different request answers "
#~ "`409`. After the batch is deleted "
#~ "the key answers `410` for at least"
#~ " a day; a key is remembered "
#~ "until a day after its batch ends."
#~ " The key belongs to your account, "
#~ "so any of your API keys can "
#~ "replay it, and a replay never "
#~ "changes which key the batch runs "
#~ "under. The SDKs do not send this"
#~ " header for you."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在创建调用中发送 `Idempotency-Key` "
#~ "请求头（两种输入方式都可以），即可安全地重试。同一个键配同一个请求（Messages 批次还要求 "
#~ "`anthropic_version` "
#~ "相同）会返回第一次调用创建的批次，即使你的配额此后已用完或角色已变化；同一个键配不同的请求返回 "
#~ "`409`。批次删除后，该键至少一天内返回 `410`；键会一直记住，直到其批次结束后一天。键属于你的账户，所以你的任何 "
#~ "API 密钥都能重放它，重放也绝不会改变批次运行所用的密钥。SDK 不会替你发送这个请求头。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When a batch ends, after its "
#~ "results can be read, the gateway "
#~ "POSTs an event: `batch.completed`, "
#~ "`batch.failed`, `batch.expired` or "
#~ "`batch.cancelled`, whatever the batch's "
#~ "target. (An event a previous version "
#~ "queued for a Message Batch before "
#~ "the upgrade is still delivered as "
#~ "`message_batch.ended`.) The body names the "
#~ "batch only (`{\"id\", \"object\": \"event\","
#~ " \"type\", \"created_at\", \"data\": {\"id\"}}`);"
#~ " fetch the results with your API "
#~ "key. Deliveries are signed as Standard"
#~ " Webhooks are: verify `webhook-signature`"
#~ " (`v1,` and a base64 HMAC-SHA256 "
#~ "of `\"{webhook-id}.{webhook-timestamp}.{body}\"` "
#~ "with the secret's base64 part as "
#~ "the key). A delivery that is not"
#~ " answered with a `2xx` is retried "
#~ "with backoff, up to eight attempts; "
#~ "the same event can arrive more "
#~ "than once, so deduplicate on "
#~ "`webhook-id`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "批次结束、其结果可读之后，网关会 POST "
#~ "一个事件：`batch.completed`、`batch.failed`、`batch.expired` 或 "
#~ "`batch.cancelled`，与批次的目标无关。（升级前旧版本为某个 Message Batch "
#~ "排队的事件，仍以 `message_batch.ended` 投递。）请求体只指明批次（`{\"id\", "
#~ "\"object\": \"event\", \"type\", \"created_at\", "
#~ "\"data\": {\"id\"}}`）；请用你的 API 密钥获取结果。投递按 "
#~ "Standard Webhooks 的方式签名：校验 `webhook-"
#~ "signature`（`v1,` 加上以密钥的 base64 部分为 key、对 "
#~ "`\"{webhook-id}.{webhook-timestamp}.{body}\"` 计算的"
#~ " base64 HMAC-SHA256）。没有得到 `2xx` "
#~ "回应的投递会带退避重试，最多八次；同一事件可能到达不止一次，请按 `webhook-id` 去重。"

