#~ msgid ""
#~ "A worker only runs the kinds of"
#~ " batch it knows: claims, expiry, "
#~ "finalizing, validation, sealing and cleanup"
#~ " all skip a batch whose surface, "
#~ "target or schema version is newer "
#~ "than the worker's. The workers that "
#~ "do not know this are the old "
#~ "ones: a gateway older than the one"
#~ " that added file batches and the "
#~ "former Message Batches (before #1660) "
#~ "has no such filter and would run"
#~ " their requests as chat completions. "
#~ "New code cannot change what an old"
#~ " process already running does, so "
#~ "before upgrading from one of those "
#~ "versions, make sure no old worker "
#~ "is running alongside the new version:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "worker 只运行它认识的批次种类：领取、过期、收尾、校验、封存和清理都会跳过 surface、target"
#~ " 或 schema version 比 worker "
#~ "新的批次。不认识这一点的是旧 worker：比加入文件批次和原 Message Batches "
#~ "的版本更早的网关（#1660 之前）没有这种过滤，会把它们的请求当作 Chat Completions"
#~ " 运行。新代码无法改变已经在运行的旧进程的行为，所以从这些版本升级之前，请确保没有旧 worker "
#~ "与新版本同时运行："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "On the old version, turn `BATCH_ENABLED`"
#~ " off (Settings tab, or `python -m "
#~ "serving.config.manage set BATCH_ENABLED false`). "
#~ "Within about ten seconds every old "
#~ "process stops claiming and sweeping, and"
#~ " logs that its batch worker is "
#~ "disabled. A request it was already "
#~ "running finishes or is handed back; "
#~ "those are chat batches, which the "
#~ "new version runs too."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在旧版本上关闭 `BATCH_ENABLED`（通过 Settings 页，或 "
#~ "`python -m serving.config.manage set "
#~ "BATCH_ENABLED false`）。约十秒内，每个旧进程都会停止领取和扫描批次，并记录 batch "
#~ "worker 已停用。已经运行的请求会完成或交还；这些都是聊天批次，新版本也能处理。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Upgrade every gateway process. The new"
#~ " processes start with `BATCH_ENABLED` still"
#~ " off."
#~ msgstr "升级每个网关进程。新进程启动时，`BATCH_ENABLED` 仍保持关闭。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Once no process of the old version"
#~ " is left (check your process manager"
#~ " or orchestrator, not only the health"
#~ " endpoint), turn `BATCH_ENABLED` on."
#~ msgstr "确认没有任何旧版本进程后（检查进程管理器或编排器，不能只看健康检查接口），再开启 `BATCH_ENABLED`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Stopping every old process before any"
#~ " new one starts is equally safe. "
#~ "From a version that already has "
#~ "file batches and the former Message "
#~ "Batches (#1660 or later), a rolling "
#~ "upgrade needs none of this. Messages "
#~ "batches created through `/v1/batches` are "
#~ "kinds those workers do not know, "
#~ "so while old processes are still "
#~ "running they neither run, validate, seal"
#~ " nor expire them; only this version's"
#~ " workers do. A create for the "
#~ "Messages target that an old process "
#~ "happens to answer is refused with "
#~ "`400` (it does not know the "
#~ "target); retry it, or wait until "
#~ "every process runs this version. Until"
#~ " the last old process is gone, "
#~ "a client may still reach the old"
#~ " `/v1/messages/batches` on one of them; "
#~ "batches it creates there are drained "
#~ "by this version as described in "
#~ "[Moving from Message Batches](#moving-from-"
#~ "message-batches)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "先停掉所有旧进程再启动新进程同样安全。如果是从已经有文件批次和原 Message Batches "
#~ "的版本（#1660 或之后）升级，滚动升级不需要以上任何步骤。通过 `/v1/batches` 创建的"
#~ " Messages 批次是这些 worker "
#~ "不认识的种类，所以旧进程还在运行时，它们既不运行、校验、封存，也不过期这些批次；只有本版本的 worker "
#~ "会处理。恰好由旧进程处理的 Messages 目标创建请求会得到 "
#~ "`400`（旧进程不认识该目标）；请重试，或等到所有进程都运行本版本。在最后一个旧进程退出之前，客户端仍可能在某个旧进程上访问到旧的 "
#~ "`/v1/messages/batches`；在那里创建的批次由本版本按[从 Message Batches "
#~ "迁移](#moving-from-message-batches)中所述的方式排空。"
